      "description": "Karttikeya. East niche of the tower, Parashurameshvara Temple, Bhubaneshwar\nKarttikeya, the warrior son of Shiva, holds a spear and sits on a throne. Below the throne, his peacock is killing a snake. Just above Karttikeya, the lintel of the niche is carved with a panel showing an assembly of the gods.",
